{
  "summary": "This experiment tested replacing the RNA encoder (pca_n2000 → scvi_n200) in a multimodal multiprofile setup with avgpool aggregation and concat fusion, building on a prior high-performing configuration (0.6186 accuracy). Validation accuracy improved to 0.6315, suggesting the RNA encoder choice may influence performance, though the slight drop in F1 (0.6068 vs. 0.6103) introduces uncertainty. The role of other design choices, such as aggregation or fusion methods, remains unisolated without direct comparative benchmarks."
}

